{
  "_note": "**今日进度(22)** —— 跨所有事项:今天达标了几件 / 一共几件。入参 {mask}。\n段数 = 事项总数(最多 8),超出的段涂卡底色隐形 —— 比例条要算宽度,而 RCN 的 `{}` 布局表达式\n里混不进 `${}` 数据变量(三类严格区分),硬算只能靠在 df 里拼布局串,没有先例且风险高。\n分段还更贴语义:5 件事就是 5 格,一眼数得出来。",
  "version": 1,
  "actions": [
    {
      "_note": "入参先落地成 data 域的键(§9.5 #3),再由 resultFilter 透出去 —— **RCN 只看得见 flow 的输出**,shell params 不进渲染域。`mask` 决定卡上打不打码(打码开关在事项页,经 pickWidgets 的 per-item params 传进来)。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "mask",
        "value": "${mask}"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "跨事项聚合的真源:`agg = {total, byDay}`,由页面 JS 的 computeAgg() 算好整份落盘(flow 没有 map/filter,遍历所有事项的 byDay 只能在 JS 里做)。",
      "id": "agg",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "agg",
        "default": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "total",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${agg.total},0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "byDay",
        "value": "${agg.byDay}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nowMs",
        "value": "${@time.nowMs}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "todayMs",
        "value": "$[parseDate::(formatDate::(${nowMs},yyyy-MM-dd),yyyy-MM-dd)]"
      },
      "_note": "按自然日归零再相减,否则同一天的上午/下午会算出不同天数(同 today.df / days.df)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "todayKey",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(${nowMs},yyyy-MM-dd)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "done",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(get::(${byDay},${todayKey}),0)]"
      },
      "_note": "「今天」由**卡片**算,不从盘上读 —— agg 里只有历史事实。存成「今天 3/5」的话,用户今天打完卡就不再开 App,明天桌面卡还挂着昨天那个数,而且不报错。"
    },
    {
      "_note": "日期锚(标准 §4.4)。「今天 2/5」里的「今天」是哪一天,只有把日期写在卡上才答得了 —— 桌面小组件的封面缓存 key 不含时间维度,不写日期就分不出这张是不是停在昨天。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "dateLbl",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(${nowMs},MM-dd)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "left",
        "value": "$[calc::(${total}-${done})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "allDone",
        "value": "$[if::(ge::(${done},${total}),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "hasAny",
        "value": "$[if::(ge::(${total},1),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "on",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${mask},1),#DCDDE0|#33353B,#2E9E6B|#45C793)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "off",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${mask},1),#DCDDE0|#33353B,#EDEEF0|#20232A)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "gone",
        "value": "#FFFFFF|#15171A"
      },
      "_note": "第 n 段超出事项总数时涂成**卡底色** = 隐形。透明色各端解析不一(有的认 8 位 hex 有的不认),涂底色零风险。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "g0",
        "value": "$[if::(ge::(${total},1),if::(ge::(${done},1),${on},${off}),${gone})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "g1",
        "value": "$[if::(ge::(${total},2),if::(ge::(${done},2),${on},${off}),${gone})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "g2",
        "value": "$[if::(ge::(${total},3),if::(ge::(${done},3),${on},${off}),${gone})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "g3",
        "value": "$[if::(ge::(${total},4),if::(ge::(${done},4),${on},${off}),${gone})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "g4",
        "value": "$[if::(ge::(${total},5),if::(ge::(${done},5),${on},${off}),${gone})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "g5",
        "value": "$[if::(ge::(${total},6),if::(ge::(${done},6),${on},${off}),${gone})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "g6",
        "value": "$[if::(ge::(${total},7),if::(ge::(${done},7),${on},${off}),${gone})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "g7",
        "value": "$[if::(ge::(${total},8),if::(ge::(${done},8),${on},${off}),${gone})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_den",
        "value": "$[if::(ge::(${total},1),${total},1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "完成环的扫角(2026-10-08 progress 22 改完成环):打码 / 没有事项时 0;做满恒 360。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "sweep",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${mask},1),0,if::(ge::(${done},${total}),if::(ge::(${total},1),360,0),round::(calc::(360*${done}/${_den}))))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "只透出 RCN 读的键(G44):入参注入(@i18n/@app)与中间量(agg/nowMs/k*/v*/e0/p*)不进渲染域、不落盘。2026-09-13。",
      "action": "resultFilter",
      "params": {
        "keys": [
          "allDone",
          "dateLbl",
          "done",
          "g0",
          "g1",
          "g2",
          "g3",
          "g4",
          "g5",
          "g6",
          "g7",
          "hasAny",
          "left",
          "mask",
          "sweep",
          "total"
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
